@startuml Preciazo_Event_Storming_identity_access
top to bottom direction
title Preciazo - Design-Level Event Storming: Identity and Access (AV2 - US06 / TS01)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 28
skinparam rectanglePadding 12
rectangle "Registration Options\nSupported personas and password requirements" as read0 <<Read Model>> #B3EDBE
rectangle "Visitor" as actor0 <<Actor>> #FFE08A
rectangle "Register User" as cmd0 <<Command>> #ACDAFA
rectangle "User" as agg0 <<Aggregate>> #FFF1AE
rectangle "User Registered" as evt0 <<Domain Event>> #FFD0A1
read0 -right-> actor0
actor0 -right-> cmd0
cmd0 -right-> agg0
agg0 -right-> evt0
rectangle "Sign-in Screen\nRetry time or security-check requirement" as read1 <<Read Model>> #B3EDBE
rectangle "Buyer / Merchant" as actor1 <<Actor>> #FFE08A
rectangle "Authenticate User" as cmd1 <<Command>> #ACDAFA
rectangle "User" as agg1 <<Aggregate>> #FFF1AE
rectangle "Sign-in Accepted" as evt1 <<Domain Event>> #FFD0A1
read1 -right-> actor1
actor1 -right-> cmd1
cmd1 -right-> agg1
agg1 -right-> evt1
read0 -[hidden]down-> read1
actor0 -[hidden]down-> actor1
cmd0 -[hidden]down-> cmd1
agg0 -[hidden]down-> agg1
evt0 -[hidden]down-> evt1
rectangle "Sign-in Failed\nKnown account; failed counter saved" as failure <<Domain Event>> #FFD0A1
rectangle "Account Temporarily Locked\nOnly when the configured threshold is reached" as locked <<Domain Event>> #FFD0A1
agg1 -down-> failure
agg1 -down-> locked
rectangle "Hash Verification / Required Security Check\nApplication ports; proof provider contract pending" as verification <<Application Operation>> #FFB2DF
rectangle "Signed Access Token\nReturn after successful decision and state save" as token <<Application Result>> #FFB2DF
verification -right-> token
failure -[hidden]down-> verification
rectangle "Buyer / Merchant" as reader <<Actor>> #FFE08A
rectangle "Get My Profile / Get My Access" as query <<Query>> #B3EDBE
rectangle "Own Profile and Current Permissions\nNo password hash or token in read models" as view <<Read Model>> #B3EDBE
reader -right-> query
query -right-> view
verification -[hidden]down-> reader
rectangle "Lock expiry is evaluated on request, not a scheduled event.\nJWT issuance is not a persisted session; logout discards the client token.\nNo public assignment of arbitrary roles, permissions or fiscal verification.\nDomain events contain no credentials, password hashes or bearer tokens." as rule <<Business Rule>> #FFF1AE
rectangle "Configure lock threshold/duration, password policy and JWT parameters.\nDefine security proof provider, binding, single-use validation and deadline.\nRole lifecycle, global attempt limiting and account recovery remain pending.\nNo ACL, refresh-token flow or unsupported single-token revocation." as hotspot <<Hotspot>> #FFB7AB
reader -[hidden]down-> rule
rule -[hidden]down-> hotspot
@enduml
